<title>NETHERLANDS: Bijenkorf 1996/97 net NLG 61.7 mln.</title>
<headline>Bijenkorf 1996/97 net NLG 61.7 mln.</headline>
<dateline>AMSTERDAM 1997-04-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>Year 1996/97 to Jan 31, 97.</p>
<p>(in millions of guilders unless otherwise stated)</p>
<p>    Net profit from ordinary ops    61.7  vs  98.6</p>
<p>    Total net profit		    61.7  vs 146.2</p>
<p>    Turnover (billions)		  5.97 vs   5.87</p>
<p>    Tax				     33.7  vs  52.0</p>
<p>    Dividend (guilders)		  3.00 vs   3.40</p>
<p>    Net per shr (guilders)	     5.27 vs  12.40</p>
<p>    Extraordinary gains/charges	NIL  vs  47.6 gain</p>
<p>    Associates' income		   2.5  vs   2.4</p>
<p>    Minorities' charge		   0.3  vs   0.3</p>
<p>NOTE - Retailer Koninklijke Bijenkorf Beheer NV (KBB) earlier this year said it expected a 1996/97 total net profit of about 61 million guilders.</p>
<p>-- Amsterdam newsroom +31 20 504 5000, Fax +31 20 504 5040</p>
